abstract: >
  CryingCatalyst is a consolidated, queryable SQLite database of Bangladesh
  macroeconomic indicators spanning national accounts, prices and inflation,
  the external sector, monetary and financial data, the fiscal sector, and
  labour and demographics — compiled from Bangladesh Bank, BBS, the Ministry
  of Finance, NBR, the World Bank, the IMF, the ADB, EPB, and BIDA.
